{{#*inline "page"}}

<p>
    <a href="/">Home</a> | Settings
</p>
<hr>

<h2>Settings</h2>

<h3><code>fetch_new_game_clips_cron</code></h3>
<p>

    Cron expression which controls how often to fetch new game clips.
    This changes the frequency of triggering a job.
    <br>
    Restart the app to apply changes.

    <pre>
        format:    sec    min   hour   day of month   month   day of week   year
        actual:    {{settings.fetch_new_game_clips_cron}}
    </pre>

    <form action="/settings/put" method="post">
        <textarea
            name="fetch_new_game_clips_cron"
            id="fetch_new_game_clips_cron"
            cols="50"
        >{{settings.fetch_new_game_clips_cron}}</textarea>

        <button>Save</button>
    </form>
</p>

<h3><code>recorded_at_least_hours_ago</code></h3>
<p>
    We only store clips which are <b>at least</b>
    <code>{{settings.recorded_at_least_hours_ago}}</code> hours old.
    After this time, the clips will have presumably accumulated some views.
    We use clip views as a metric to rank clips.
    <br>
    Restart the app to apply changes.

    <form action="/settings/put" method="post">
        <input
            type="number"
            name="recorded_at_least_hours_ago"
            id="recorded_at_least_hours_ago"
            value="{{settings.recorded_at_least_hours_ago}}"
        >

        <button>Save</button>
    </form>
</p>

<h3><code>map_clips_to_groups_cron</code></h3>
<p>

    Cron expression which controls how often to look for new clips to map to
    each group that was created from query criteria.
    This changes the frequency of triggering a job.
    <br>
    Restart the app to apply changes.

    <pre>
        format:    sec    min   hour   day of month   month   day of week   year
        actual:    {{settings.map_clips_to_groups_cron}}
    </pre>

    <form action="/settings/put" method="post">
        <textarea
            name="map_clips_to_groups_cron"
            id="map_clips_to_groups_cron"
            cols="50"
        >{{settings.map_clips_to_groups_cron}}</textarea>

        <button>Save</button>
    </form>
</p>

<h3><code>default_page_size</code></h3>
<p>
    How many items (clips, etc.) to show per page by default.

    <form action="/settings/put" method="post">
        <input
            type="number"
            name="default_page_size"
            id="default_page_size"
            value="{{settings.default_page_size}}"
        >

        <button>Save</button>
    </form>
</p>

{{/inline}}
